## Domain Knowledge
- Data for period X is in bulletins AFTER period X. January data → March bulletin.
- Fiscal year ends June 30 (pre-1976) or September 30 (post-1976). Calendar year ends December 31.
- Search TABLE NAMES ("Table FD-1") — stable across decades.
- Unit headers ABOVE the table. "Public debt" ≠ "total gross federal debt."

